   "cooked": "<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>10 October 2022 and 23 October 2022</strong>. We allocated <strong>3155.7</strong> TEC tokens for rewards, with a <strong>59:40</strong> split between Praise and Sourcecred. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute. <strong>Also included in this distribution is the 10th and final round of retroactive sourcecred distributions!</strong></p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=10\" title=\":pray:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=10\" title=\":balance_scale:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=10\" title=\":memo:\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a href=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/CommonsBuild/tec-rewards/661ccb0c33163d1d8d9dcc06fc9dc01da921c739/distribution_rounds/round-20/distribution_results/reports/round-20--general-round-analysis-report.html\">full period analysis here</a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=10\" title=\":bar_chart:\"/></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=10\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Username</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">acidlazzer#5796</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">215.396</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">itsyaboi#2591</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">149.808</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Zeptimus#3359</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">126.924</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">miguelb#5176</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">124.972</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">r-x-x#8344</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">92.8364</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">BiancaGadelha#2667</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">90.456</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">durgadas#9280</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">85.219</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Juankbell#7458</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">83.7432</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">natesuits#4789</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">77.7604</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">pat.zip (TE Academy)<span class=\"hashtag\">#5266</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">69.4289</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">akrtws (TE Academy)<span class=\"hashtag\">#4246</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">69.4289</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">ddan#2489</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">61.0974</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">GideonRo#3175</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">61.0974</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">alantv#0964</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">53.9562</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">kristofer#1475</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">44.222</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">divine_comedian#5493</td>\n<